[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_m5vyk")
title = "Mark Ingress"
description = "The SYSTEM LIST currently underlines a missing body named Ingress situated further than Prelude. 
To learn the [i]direction[/i] to ping Ingress, the BARYCENTER VISUALIZER should be used. It displays the direction to other bodies from the locked body with a dot. Dark red dots are beyond the current scan arc.
To ping Ingress, press on 'Prelude' on the SYSTEM LIST to lock, adjust the LIDAR direction so it matches the direction of the dot which is oscillating, and press the 'PING!' button.
* [i]Only wormholes oscillate on the BARYCENTER VISUALIZER.[/i]
* [i]If a dot is beyond the current scan arc, set the arc to a lower length with the slider.[/i]
[img=150%x75%]res://graphics/objective/tutorial_barycenter_example.png[/img]"
